    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Hospitality  Business Opportunity to acquire a  Coastal Bar, Restaurant and  Guesthouse."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: Fully Equipped Bar with Keg Cold Room (2 years old), Toilets (Ladies & Gents) off. Commercial Kitchen, Guest Dining Room (35 covers), Guest Sitting Room, Children's Toy Room, Guest Entrance Hall.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: 8 Guest Bedrooms with Ensuite Shower Rooms, 2 Linen Store Rooms, Office.  \r\n\r\nServices: Mains Water & Drainage, Oil Fired Central Heating, Electricity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The Bay View Bar & Guest House is set along one of Ireland’s most scenic stretches of the Wild Atlantic Way, this impressive licensed premises, with 8-bedroom guesthouse & restaurant offers a rare opportunity to acquire an established hospitality business in a truly outstanding coastal setting.\r\nCombining charm, comfort and commercial potential, the property enjoys a picturesque location surrounded by breathtaking sea views, rugged coastline and the natural beauty that attracts visitors to the area year-round. Renowned for its hospitality and relaxed atmosphere, the guesthouse has become a popular destination for tourists, walkers and locals alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises eight well-appointed guest bedrooms together with spacious dining and guest areas designed to cater for both short stays and longer coastal retreats. The inviting restaurant and fully licensed bar provide an excellent setting for residents and visitors to enjoy locally sourced cuisine and a welcoming social atmosphere.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned along the Wild Atlantic Way, the property benefits from a steady tourism trade and offers enormous scope for further growth and development. This is an ideal opportunity for owner-operators, investors or those seeking a lifestyle change in one of Ireland’s most beautiful coastal regions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER:"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By Appointment Only"
      }
    ],
